{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3d7ab777-470f-8f75-8bff-2ab126fe710b",
  "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:15:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gino Iannuccilli",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:09:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:09:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. Yes, um, my name is Gino Iannuccilli. I have a question about a fence. I think maybe I need something, a paper, but I am not sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good morning Gino. Sure, let's talk about it. Are you looking to put up a new fence at your home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:10:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. My neighbor, he is putting up a fence now, they started yesterday, and I think, okay, I want the same thing. So I want to know what I do first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:10:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And do you own the house, or are you renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I own. I am the homeowner, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:10:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. What kind of fence are you thinking? Material, height, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:10:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aluminum, black color. Six feet tall. Like the, the bars going up, not the solid one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, black aluminum picket style, six feet. And it's going around the back yard, the front, the whole lot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:10:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, the back and one side. Not the front. [pause] Sorry, one second, my back. I am stretching it. I was carrying boxes this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:10:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, better. So, my question is, do I need a permit for this? Or I just call the city and tell you, and that is all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:11:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. In general, a fence does need a permit here, so it's not just a phone call to let us know. You'd apply first, and then once it's approved you can build. Six feet is on the taller side, so that's something they'll look at closely."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:11:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. So my neighbor, he must have a permit also?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:11:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He should have, yes. I can't speak to his specific job, but that's how it normally works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:11:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I understand. So I do not call only, I make an application. Is it, I fill a form, or I go to the office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:11:47-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can do either. There's an application you can pick up here at City Hall, and you'd usually include a simple drawing of your lot showing where the fence goes. It doesn't have to be fancy. A copy of your survey or plot plan helps a lot if you have one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:12:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Survey. Hm. This is the paper from when I bought the house? With the lines?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:12:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's usually it. Closing documents often have a plot plan or a survey. Look through what you got when you bought."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:12:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will look. [pause] Sorry. And my second question. How close to the property line can I put the fence? Can it be right on the line? Or I need to leave some space?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:12:35-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's one of the things the review looks at. There are setback rules, and they can depend on your zoning district and on the height. I don't want to give you a number that's wrong for your lot. If you give me your address, I can look up the district and have someone confirm the distance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:12:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. I, um, I prefer not to give address on this call now. I just want to understand the steps first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:13:05-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Then here's what I'd suggest. When you come in or call back with the address, we'll check the district and tell you the exact distance from the line. Until then, I'd say don't buy anything or mark any posts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:13:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So not right on the line, maybe. It depends."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:13:26-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the lot, yes. Some places allow it closer, some want it pulled back. It's also worth knowing exactly where your line is, because if the fence ends up on your neighbor's side, that's a problem later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:13:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. That is why I ask. I do not want a problem with the neighbor. He is nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:13:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So the survey will help there too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:13:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And the fence, the black aluminum. Is there a rule about the style? Like, the bars, the space between?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:14:01-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There can be requirements on the finished side facing out and on how open it is, but I don't have those details in front of me. The person reviewing your application can go over it. Do you want me to have someone from the office call you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please. That is good. My number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:14:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-two. And it's Gino, G-I-N-O, and the last name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:14:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Iannuccilli. I-A-N-N-U-C-C-I-L-L-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:14:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll put a note that you're asking about a six-foot black aluminum fence, back and one side, and the distance from the property line. They'll probably call you today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:14:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, to say again, so I am sure. I need a permit. I bring the form, with the drawing, and the survey if I have. And the distance, they tell me when they know the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:14:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly right. You've got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:15:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much, Anita. Very helpful. I think maybe I still have to read the form, it will be a lot of words for me. [pause] Ah, my back again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:15:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go sit down for a minute. And if the form doesn't make sense, call or stop in and we'll walk through it with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:15:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I will. Thank you. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-02T10:15:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Gino. Bye now."
    }
  ],
